# Zero-Lag - Windsurf rules

Read `AGENTS.md` then `CLAUDE.md` before editing. Both bind, and this file
adds nothing of its own. Everything lives in one place so the rules cannot
drift apart.

- Project law: `CLAUDE.md`
- How to work: `AGENTS.md`
- Skills catalog: `.agent/master-skills.json`
- Quality bar: `.agent/quality-bar.json`
- Locked design: `DESIGN.md`

If a skill or a quality-bar item fights `CLAUDE.md`, `CLAUDE.md` wins.

Never start an APK / EAS / Actions build unless the user names the number.
Run `npm test` before claiming done.
